Coin Dojo
=========

An open-source toolkit that turns your own arcade cabinet into a custom
ES-DE / RetroArch emulation setup. It ships the METHOD, not the content.


SHIP-NO-ARTIFACTS PRINCIPLE
---------------------------
This project deliberately ships ONLY automation and instructions. It does NOT
include, and will never include:

  - no Pi image (.img) or flashable OS image
  - no launcher or emulator binaries
  - no ROMs or game files
  - no BIOS or firmware
  - no game artwork, box art, character art, logos, marquees, or bezels

Users supply their own stock backup and their own legally-owned game files.
This is both the legal boundary and the design north star.


