  - RetroArch ......... GPLv3
  - libretro cores .... GPLv2, MPL-2.0, and four NON-COMMERCIAL licenses
                        (FBNeo, MAME 2003-Plus, Snes9x, Genesis Plus GX)
  - ES-DE ............. MIT
  - Box64 ............. MIT;  Wine: LGPL;  Electron: MIT + Chromium licenses
  - Fightcade ......... proprietary; downloaded by the user, never shared
  - CRT shaders ....... libretro/glsl-shaders, their own licenses

Because of the non-commercial components, a cabinet set up with this project
must never be sold, rented out, run for paid play, or bundled commercially.

